    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d44">

                <pb facs="0202" n="182" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg182"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 728.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-06-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 23, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> After a long interval Lord Russell has
                    resumed the correspondence, copies of the first portion of which I transmitted
                    to you with my despatch No. 663, of the 21st of April last.</p>
                <p>I now transmit copies of the two last notes which have passed on the same
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d44-a1.xml" xpointer="d44-a1"/>
            </div>
